-- statement:
--   Let $t\in\mathbb N$ and let $E$ be any predicate on finite Boolean lists. The set $\mathcal B=\{b:|b|=t,\ E(b)\}$ is finite and satisfies $$|\mathcal B|\,2^{-t}\le1.$$ The source expresses this inequality in the extended nonnegative reals.
